.SH NAME
bpsendfile \- Bundle Protocol (BP) file transmission utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBbpsendfile\fR \fIown_endpoint_ID\fR \fIdestination_endpoint_ID\fR \fIfile_name\fR [\fIclass_of_service\fR [\fItime_to_live (seconds)\fR ]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBbpsendfile\fR uses \fBbp_send()\fR to issue a single bundle to a designated
destination endpoint, containing the contents of the file identified by
\&\fIfile_name\fR, then terminates.  The bundle is sent with no custody transfer
requested.  When \fIclass_of_service\fR is omitted, the bundle is sent at
standard priority; for details of the \fIclass_of_service\fR parameter,
see \fBbptrace\fR\|(1).  \fItime_to_live\fR, if not specified, defaults to 300
seconds (5 minutes).  \fBNOTE\fR that \fItime_to_live\fR is specified \fBAFTER\fR
\&\fIclass_of_service\fR, rather than before it as in \fBbptrace\fR\|(1).
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBbpsendfile\fR has terminated.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
No configuration files are needed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
The following diagnostics may be issued to the \fBion.log\fR log file:
.IP "Can't attach to BP." 4
.IX Item "Can't attach to BP."
\&\fBbpadmin\fR has not yet initialized BP operations.
.IP "Can't open own endpoint." 4
.IX Item "Can't open own endpoint."
Another BP application task currently has \fIown_endpoint_ID\fR open for
bundle origination and reception.  Try again after that task has terminated.
If no such task exists, it may have crashed while still holding the endpoint
open; the easiest workaround is to select a different source endpoint.
.IP "Can't stat the file" 4
.IX Item "Can't stat the file"
Operating system error.  Check errtext, correct problem, and rerun.
.IP "bpsendfile can't create file ref." 4
.IX Item "bpsendfile can't create file ref."
Probably an unrecoverable database error, in which case the local ION
node must be terminated and re-initialized.
.IP "bpsendfile can't create ZCO." 4
.IX Item "bpsendfile can't create ZCO."
Probably an unrecoverable database error, in which case the local ION
node must be terminated and re-initialized.
.IP "bpsendfile can't send file in bundle." 4
.IX Item "bpsendfile can't send file in bundle."
BP system error.  Check for earlier diagnostic messages describing the
cause of the error; correct problem and rerun.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
